1
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:44,208
Next, I'll introduce the personalities and abilities of each type of cat on the board.

2
00:01:44,568 --> 00:01:46,468
Getty! This is so much fun!

3
00:01:46,788 --> 00:01:49,048
Great! Let's continue.

4
00:01:52,508 --> 00:01:53,568
The Pawn!

5
00:01:54,248 --> 00:01:57,728
He's a hard worker who moves ahead one step at a time, meow!

6
00:01:57,728 --> 00:02:03,388
I may be the weakest piece on the board, but I'm very important to the match. You need me to win!

7
00:02:04,508 --> 00:02:09,008
The Lance! He's a single-minded fellow who's as straight as an arrow.

8
00:02:09,248 --> 00:02:12,968
I'll keep marching us forward to victory, but I can't move back, meow!

9
00:02:14,368 --> 00:02:18,348
The Knight! He hops to the left and to the right.

10
00:02:18,488 --> 00:02:22,368
I'm the only one that can jump over the heads of enemies as well as allies!

11
00:02:22,368 --> 00:02:27,728
The Silver General! He's a cool guy with a little bit of an attitude.

12
00:02:28,128 --> 00:02:31,888
I'm the star of cool attacks. I'm really good for both offense and defense.

13
00:02:32,668 --> 00:02:38,148
The Gold General! The King's trusted and courageous protector. He's the Royal Guard!

14
00:02:38,288 --> 00:02:43,848
I'm good at defending my king! I'm the perfect choice for getting close and capturing the enemy's king!

15
00:02:43,848 --> 00:02:48,988
The Rook! The strongest warrior! A true hero, meow!

16
00:02:49,608 --> 00:02:55,528
I can fly both horizontally and vertically! I'm popular with men and women of all ages, meow!

17
00:02:56,468 --> 00:03:02,108
The Bishop! A heavyweight missile that's effective diagonally as far as the eye can see!

18
00:03:02,448 --> 00:03:08,508
I'm a loner who risks his life! Make sure to be careful whenever it's my turn to attack! My defense might be weak!

19
00:03:09,348 --> 00:03:10,308
The King!

20
00:03:10,308 --> 00:03:15,528
Without me, there's no point to the game! So make sure I'm protected, meow!

21
00:03:15,988 --> 00:03:21,388
If I get captured, then the game's over and you lose! So make sure I'm given a lot of TLC, meow!

22
00:03:21,728 --> 00:03:24,648
Only the King is allowed to move in every direction? Wow!

23
00:03:24,788 --> 00:03:27,408
That's right! He is the King after all!

24
00:03:27,668 --> 00:03:31,048
And he's a great fighter if you're ever stuck in a tight spot!

25
00:03:31,608 --> 00:03:35,308
How cool! So each piece has its own personality!

26
00:03:35,828 --> 00:03:38,908
Yeah, but that's not all that's awesome about the Shogi Land Kitties!

27
00:03:38,908 --> 00:03:43,108
Guess what happens when they finally reach the enemy camp after a long, tireless trek!

28
00:03:45,508 --> 00:03:49,768
Just one more step and I'm finally in the enemy camp! Meow!

29
00:03:50,408 --> 00:03:51,708
They transform!

30
00:03:53,208 --> 00:03:57,808
Yes, I'm here! I've reached the enemy camp! Yay! I got promoted!

31
00:03:57,808 --> 00:03:59,808
Congratulations! Here you go!

32
00:03:59,808 --> 00:04:00,808
Congratulations! Here you go!

33
00:04:00,808 --> 00:04:02,028
Wow! Wee!

34
00:04:02,028 --> 00:04:03,028
Wow! Wee!

35
00:04:03,028 --> 00:04:04,028
So cool!

36
00:04:06,028 --> 00:04:08,028
Damn you, Nikaido!

37
00:04:08,028 --> 00:04:11,448
But I gotta admit, this book is pretty easy to understand.

38
00:04:11,448 --> 00:04:12,948
I wonder where he got it.

39
00:04:12,948 --> 00:04:13,948
Huh?

40
00:04:13,948 --> 00:04:17,028
There's no publisher, or barcode.

41
00:04:17,028 --> 00:04:19,028
And there's no price on it either.

42
00:04:19,028 --> 00:04:20,528
But it looks so professional.

43
00:04:23,528 --> 00:04:24,728
What the heck?!

44
00:04:27,028 --> 00:04:28,728
Nikaido, don't tell me you did this!

45
00:04:28,728 --> 00:04:30,228
Sure did! I wrote and drew it!

46
00:04:30,228 --> 00:04:31,928
I'm surprised you even noticed!

47
00:04:31,928 --> 00:04:34,628
Wow! Really? No way! That's amazing!

48
00:04:34,628 --> 00:04:36,828
I wish I could draw like that! That's really good!

49
00:04:36,828 --> 00:04:37,828
Magic!

50
00:04:37,828 --> 00:04:41,828
Am I making it easy enough to understand?

51
00:04:41,828 --> 00:04:46,828
Young master, this is lovely! Never have I seen such wonderful work!

52
00:04:46,828 --> 00:04:50,828
I have loved drawing and painting ever since I was a little kid.

53
00:04:50,828 --> 00:04:54,828
I was hoping my work could help make Shogi more popular, even if just a little.

54
00:04:54,828 --> 00:05:00,828
And since I went to the trouble of making it, I had a professional printing company throw together this printing of the book.

55
00:05:00,828 --> 00:05:04,828
And I distributed copies to relatives at our family New Year's party.

56
00:05:04,828 --> 00:05:06,828
That's incredible!

57
00:05:06,828 --> 00:05:08,828
No, no, no, no.

58
00:05:08,828 --> 00:05:11,828
Do you have tradition, gold leaf, cloth cover, holographic embossed, family?

59
00:05:11,828 --> 00:05:12,828
Throw them together!

60
00:05:16,828 --> 00:05:19,828
I'm so happy they were sincerely interested in Shogi.

61
00:05:22,828 --> 00:05:26,828
The best thing to do at this point is to introduce the detailed rules as they go.

62
00:05:26,828 --> 00:05:29,828
We did get through a lot for the first day though.

63
00:05:29,828 --> 00:05:32,828
That's pretty good progress for teaching them the basics.

64
00:05:32,828 --> 00:05:33,828
Yes!

65
00:05:33,828 --> 00:05:34,828
You see what I mean, Ray?

66
00:05:34,828 --> 00:05:38,828
This is how you build the future, by taking one small step at a time.

67
00:05:38,828 --> 00:05:42,828
You know the station's the other way, right? How long are you planning on following me?

68
00:05:42,828 --> 00:05:44,828
What are you talking about? We're going to your apartment now!

69
00:05:44,828 --> 00:05:45,828
W-w-wait a minute! I mean, well, no, you can't!

70
00:05:45,828 --> 00:05:49,828
Don't worry about it! Why would I shy away from spending the night at my best friend's house?

71
00:05:49,828 --> 00:05:50,828
You should shy away, and you are not my best friend!

72
00:05:50,828 --> 00:05:51,828
Don't worry, it'll be fine!

73
00:05:51,828 --> 00:05:52,828
I am worried!

74
00:05:52,828 --> 00:05:55,828
Why would I shy away from spending the night at my best friend's house?

75
00:05:55,828 --> 00:05:56,828
Don't worry, it'll be fine!

76
