I am worried! It is not fine!

78
00:05:59,828 --> 00:06:03,828
Mr. Kiriyama! Mr. Harunobu!

79
00:06:03,828 --> 00:06:07,828
Wait a minute. I mean, well, no, you can't.

80
00:06:07,828 --> 00:06:09,828
Don't worry about it.

81
00:06:09,828 --> 00:06:12,828
Why would I shy away from spending the night at my best friend's house?

82
00:06:12,828 --> 00:06:15,828
You should shy away, and you are not my best friend!

83
00:06:15,828 --> 00:06:18,828
Don't worry. It'll be fine.

84
00:06:18,828 --> 00:06:20,828
I am worried. It is not fine.

85
00:06:24,828 --> 00:06:30,828
Mr. Kiriyama, Mr. Harunobu, we'd like to welcome you home.

86
00:06:31,828 --> 00:06:32,828
Thank you.

87
00:06:32,828 --> 00:06:36,828
Sorry we're late, but if you don't mind, please take it up.

88
00:06:39,828 --> 00:06:42,828
Put it in front of the right side closet. Be careful.

89
00:06:43,828 --> 00:06:45,828
Here is dinner and breakfast for both of you.

90
00:06:45,828 --> 00:06:47,828
I hope it's to your liking.

91
00:06:49,828 --> 00:06:52,828
I was concerned about your lack of daily necessities here.

92
00:06:54,828 --> 00:06:57,828
I figured now was a good time to bring you something you could use.

93
00:06:57,828 --> 00:07:02,828
So I got you this beautiful futon that folds into a comfy couch.

94
00:07:02,828 --> 00:07:04,828
Feel free to use it when I'm away.

95
